{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0be5e17d-2170-86bc-9283-3ae2bdee24b6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T14:34:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:31:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I need to report a trash bin that got damaged by the truck. Not sure if this is the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're in the right place. Damaged by the truck, okay. Let me grab a pad here. What happened to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid's snapped off the hinge and there's a crack down the side. I put it out Wednesday night, it was fine, and this morning it's laying in the street like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, lid off, crack down the side, found it this morning. And where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "261 Bridge Street. Down The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two sixty-one Bridge Street. Got it. Sorry, one sec, I'm writing as we go. And is that the trash bin or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash. The big one with the wheels."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash, wheels, okay. Did you actually see the truck do it, or is it more that you found it after?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Found it after. But the truck's the only thing that's been down the street. [pause] Sorry, hang on, I'm wrapping some presents and this tape squeals every time I pull it. Can you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little bit, yeah. Sounds like a cat in a blender. No worries. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm back. So is there a fee for this? Replacing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally if the truck damaged it, the city looks at replacing or repairing it and it's not something you get charged for. I can't tell you the exact process off the top of my head, but I'll put it in as a damaged-bin report and a supervisor will confirm with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I might get charged, or I might not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's the truck's doing, I wouldn't expect a charge. But I'll note that you asked about it so they address it when they call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Do I leave it out? Or bring it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd bring it up by the house, out of the road, and keep it handy so somebody can look at it. If they want a photo, snap one before you move it, if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. I'll take one now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And what's the best number for you? I've got the call coming up on my screen, but I'd rather confirm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-one. Got it. And it's David?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "David Sisson. Two S's, one N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sisson, okay. So I've got David Sisson, 261 Bridge Street, trash bin with a broken lid and a cracked side, found this morning after pickup, asked about a fee. Somebody should reach out in a few days, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. And in the meantime the trash goes in what, bags?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the bin's unusable by next pickup, bags set beside it is the usual workaround. Check with the supervisor when they call, though, in case they can get you a replacement before then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's all I need. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, David. Good luck with the wrapping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T14:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Thanks."
    }
  ],
